## 5. Expected Project Structure

The intended repository structure is:

```text
jessielu.github.io/
├── index.html
├── style.css
├── script.js
├── other website files...
│
└── crossy-road/
    ├── index.html
    ├── style.css
    └── script.js
```

Keeping the game inside its own folder prevents its CSS and JavaScript files from conflicting with the main website files.

---

## 6. Expected Website Behavior

The main portfolio remains accessible at:

```text
https://david555787.github.io/jessielu.github.io/
```

The Crossy Road game becomes accessible at:

```text
https://david555787.github.io/jessielu.github.io/crossy-road/
```

The Crossy Road project on the main website should link to:

```html
<a href="crossy-road/index.html">
    Crossy Road
</a>
```

Alternatively, the entire project card can be made clickable.

