## 9. Expected Git Workflow

After making the changes, the updated files should be committed and pushed to GitHub.

Example commands:

```bash
git add .
git commit -m "Add Crossy Road game to portfolio"
git push
```

After the GitHub Pages deployment updates, the game should become publicly accessible from the portfolio website.

